<title>USA: Swiss Helvetia Fund Inc president died.</title>
<headline>Swiss Helvetia Fund Inc president died.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Helvetia Fund Inc said Thursday that its president Georges de Montebello died on December 11.</p>
<p>De Montebello also served as president of Hottinger Capital Corp, adviser to the fund.</p>
<p>Rudolf Hottinger, chief operating officer of the fund and chief executive officer of Hottinger Capital, was named acting president.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
